From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Steve Becker <stevebe@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:56:22 -0700
Subject: [DomStorage] Validate namespace IDs from the renderer

A namespace ID must be a 36 character lowercase UUID string. This change
has 3 parts:

1. Updates `SessionStorageImpl` to report a bad mojo message for invalid
namespace IDs.

2. Updates `SessionStorageSQLite/LevelDB` to report corruption after
reading an invalid namespace ID from disk.

3. `SessionStorageImpl::DeleteNamespacesFromMetadataAndDatabase()` now
skips already deleted namespaces instead of requesting deletion from the
database.

Bug: 574512015
Change-Id: I257957688dddd9599f53cdcfbe9e94aeac73b575
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8614996
Commit-Queue: Steve Becker <stevebe@microsoft.com>
Reviewed-by: Rahul Singh <rahsin@microsoft.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1724966}

